Modifications made in this repository (see UPSTREAM.md for the complete list):
  * Removed the Flutter/Dart user interface and desktop packaging material.
  * Extracted Android build scripts into scripts/.
  * Vendored the libs/hbb_common submodule as a regular directory.
  * Added a JNI bridge and replaced the FRB event stream sink so that the
    Rust core can be driven by a Kotlin/Compose UI in the host application.

The original work's copyright notices and the AGPL-3.0 license text are
retained. No upstream identity fields (client id, device uuid, deviceInfo,
apiDomain) are altered: RustDesk account/OIDC login and session-level
password/2FA authentication continue to be issued by the Rust core itself
under the RustDesk client identity.

